  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/669/669-66.htm",
  "statuteText": "669:66 Town Clerk-Tax Collector. –\n\nIf a vacancy in the office of town clerk-tax collector occurs, the deputy provided for in RSA 41:45-c shall discharge the duties of the town clerk-tax collector until the selectmen fill the position of town clerk-tax collector within 30 days."
